43	 * Fallback monthly price for a dedicated IPv4. Defaults to 0 — a dedicated IP is
44	 * INCLUDED on every plan (its cost is folded into plan pricing, as the marketing
45	 * pages state). The admin `dedicated_ip_price_cents` setting is the source of
46	 * truth; use `dedicatedIpMonthlyCents()` in billing paths, not this constant.
